guios is built on kero (https://github.com/egoist/kero), MIT licence,
Copyright (c) 2026 EGOIST. The app's code in cmd/guios and internal/guios
came from kero at the commit UPSTREAM names. LICENSE.kero is kero's licence.
scripts/guios-upstream.sh lists kero's changes since then.

The daemon kero ran (kerod) is replaced by the tuios daemon. The package
internal/guios/client keeps kero's client API and implements it on the
tuios daemon's verbs. internal/guios/client/localfs.go came from kero's
kerod (internal/daemon/fs.go).

It also includes or links:

- MyGo (https://github.com/egoist/mygo), MIT licence, Copyright (c) EGOIST.
- libghostty-vt, which MyGo's terminal plugin loads, MIT licence.
- JetBrains Mono with Nerd Fonts' symbols, SIL Open Font License 1.1. See
  resources/fonts/OFL.txt.
- The icons in icons/: Framework7 Icons (MIT), Meteor Icons (MIT),
  Octicons (MIT), Lucide (ISC), Simple Icons (CC0; the logos are their
  owners' trademarks) and Pierre Icons (MIT, icons/files/LICENSE.md). See
  icons/README.md.
